# route: level=bonus_d difficulty=both source=w5_l2 ends=warp after=tally expect=no_enemies:true,painting:17,secrets:1,min_spots:6
# The club route of Feast Land D "Honey Falls" (designer D5; recorded from closed-loop macros, build/d5), played on
# both difficulties (the stage is the same on both). It never presses S (belt invariance).
# Into the honey pool: wade and hop for the food
33:R,3:RU,18:R,6:RU,17:R
# Onto the step: three strikes at the spot in the mound's face; onto the mound, three low strikes at the big spot
17:R,7:,4:RU,8:U,6:,3:R,4:,8:F,8:,8:F,8:,8:F,8:,6:RU,15:R,7:,1:L,2:,8:DF,8:,8:DF,8:,8:DF,38:
